{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_29", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 130, "width": 1048, "height": 358, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 146, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - SORT AI FROM AUTOMATION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - SORT AI FROM AUTOMATION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 181, "width": 1004, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Before anything gets ranked, every manual pile gets one question asked of it: does a human make a judgement call here, or is someone just\nmoving data from one place to another. Trade logs out of Excel into a real database, lead lists, the email tool nobody trusts, the marketing\nside - that is plain automation on AWS, no model involved. Only what needs judgement goes into the AI lane.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Before anything gets ranked, every manual pile gets one question asked of it: does a human make a judgement call here, or is someone just\nmoving data from one place to another. Trade logs out of Excel into a real database, lead lists, the email tool nobody trusts, the marketing\nside - that is plain automation on AWS, no model involved. Only what needs judgement goes into the AI lane.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_32", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": 25, "width": 700, "height": 283, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 41, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - TICKETS FIRST, CHEAPEST WIN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - TICKETS FIRST, CHEAPEST WIN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 77, "width": 656, "height": 81, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Support tickets are the cheapest real AI win you have, and the safest place to start. Ninety\ndays of tickets cluster into a short list of repeat questions, and an assistant grounded in\nyour own docs answers those and hands everything else to a person. This is not a scripted\nFAQ bot - it reads the question and cites your documentation - but it is also not a research\nproject.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Support tickets are the cheapest real AI win you have, and the safest place to start. Ninety\ndays of tickets cluster into a short list of repeat questions, and an assistant grounded in\nyour own docs answers those and hands everything else to a person. This is not a scripted\nFAQ bot - it reads the question and cites your documentation - but it is also not a research\nproject.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_35", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -42, "width": 1048, "height": 490, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -26, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - ID CHECKS SECOND", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - ID CHECKS SECOND", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": 9, "width": 1004, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "120 ID checks a week done by eye is the next thing to shrink. Document OCR pulls the fields off the upload and a face match scores the\nselfie against the ID photo. This is a vendor API, not a model you train. Clear scores decide themselves and get logged, and the ambiguous\nones still reach a human - just far fewer of them.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "120 ID checks a week done by eye is the next thing to shrink. Document OCR pulls the fields off the upload and a face match scores the\nselfie against the ID photo. This is a vendor API, not a model you train. Clear scores decide themselves and get logged, and the ambiguous\nones still reach a human - just far fewer of them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_38", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3290, "y": -122, "width": 1396, "height": 358, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -106, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - ANOMALY DETECTION, RULES BEFORE NEURAL NETS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - ANOMALY DETECTION, RULES BEFORE NEURAL NETS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -71, "width": 1352, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The most urgent item is the one to build last, and honestly. Statistical rules on trade velocity, size and z-scores catch a surprising share of suspicious patterns, and they are\nexplainable when someone asks why an account got flagged. Measure them against what your humans catch before spending a dollar on a model. If the rules genuinely miss real cases, the next\nstep is a scikit-learn model on your dataset, not TensorFlow and not deep learning.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The most urgent item is the one to build last, and honestly. Statistical rules on trade velocity, size and z-scores catch a surprising share of suspicious patterns, and they are\nexplainable when someone asks why an account got flagged. Measure them against what your humans catch before spending a dollar on a model. If the rules genuinely miss real cases, the next\nstep is a scikit-learn model on your dataset, not TensorFlow and not deep learning.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_41", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4884, "y": -31, "width": 352, "height": 359, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_42", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": -15, "width": 308, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - WHAT YOU WALK AWAY\nWITH", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - WHAT YOU WALK AWAY\nWITH", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": 48, "width": 308, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, 